{"id": 101, "name": "Yve", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/1/10/Hero1011-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021143118", "cls": ["Mage", ""], "specialty": ["Poke", "Burst"], "difficulty": "70", "stats": ["40", "80", "40", "70"], "lanes": ["Mid Lane", ""], "story": "Keeper of the equilibrium of the universe.", "skills": [{"name": "Galactic Power", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4ecac2e5d0fd547b1fe1a125069db9b0.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 52, "tagname": "Shield", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "When Yve deals damage to enemy heroes with her skills, she gains Galactic Power (cooldown: 0.5s), up to 3 stacks. Each stack provides Yve with a 120(+10*Hero Level)<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+50% Total Magic Power)</span> shield for 3s."}, {"name": "Void Blast", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2b0a9f9e2cbb187184165463c80380f1.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 3   Mana Cost: 40", "desc": "Yve detonates Galactic Energy at the target location, dealing 290<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+150% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies in the area.\nSuccessfully hitting an enemy grants Yve 55% extra Movement Speed (halved if a non-hero enemy is hit) that decreases over 1s."}, {"name": "Void Crystal", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_38145b234973cae3a6b7ca31aa75266c.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 14   Mana Cost: 80", "desc": "Yve summons a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Void Crystal</span> at the target location, dealing 220<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+40% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to nearby enemies.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Use Again</span>: Yve commands the Crystal to fire materialized energy in the target direction for 2.7s, dealing 75<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+10% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> every 0.45s to enemies hit and slowing them by 20%. Enemies hit multiple times are slowed by an extra 4% for each hit after the first hit (up to 40%)."}, {"name": "Real World Manipulation", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ee253ff416a10efd76a13cedce9aab4e.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 60   Mana Cost: 180", "desc": "Yve creates a Starfield that lasts 15s. Within the duration, you can Tap or Swipe the screen to attack up to 20 times.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Tap</span>: Deals 340<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+150% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies in the target area.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Swipe</span>: Deals 85<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+10% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> every 0.45s to enemies in the target area for 2.7s and slows them by 40%.\nEnemies leaving or entering the Starfield will be immobilized for 0.8s (only once against the same target).\nYve cannot be displaced while the Starfield is active, and the Starfield will remain even if Yve is controlled (except for Suppression)."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Arcane Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1a0d5709c23c25849cca889cb1303ecb.png"}, {"name": "Glowing Wand", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_df12c0f80844640a7b40cf64798be915.png"}, {"name": "Lightning Truncheon", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ff18dc8e5abef3934886191fe6c161a0.png